# 07_cinematic: mars_city1 intro. Traffic monitor GUI and skipCinematic, the hangar walk to R. Cooper, a cut to reception, its camera cinematic, then the PDA pickup and a pan around reception.
map game/mars_city1
capture 0 240 every=20 fps=60
at 240 skipCinematic
capture 250 420 every=10 fps=60
capture 300 307
end 2490
move 430 520 forward=127
move 525 585 yaw=-47
move 590 700 yaw=20
at 702 setviewpos -203 -1390 196 180
move 710 765 forward=127
at 775 trigger reception_trigger
at 2180 skipCinematic
impulse 2200 19
move 2210 2270 yaw=40
move 2270 2470 yaw=-30
capture 422 2490 every=60 fps=60
capture 701 705
capture 961 965
